              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Theresa Narra Quintos"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made it in much easier way, did not use the pot, I soaked sweet rice in water for almost 2 hours, drained water, mixed everything in the baking dish, baked in 350F for 60 mins came out cooked, then I cooked and put all the toppings, baked for another 5 mins, then broil for 3 mins, it was perfect !",
